@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ActivityFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12

title Command execution and record-history publication
start
:Parse command;
if (Parsing succeeds?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Report ParseException and
leave records and history unchanged;
  stop
endif
if (isTransactional()?) then (yes)
  :Copy records and preferences into a candidate\nand initially share immutable history;
else (no)
  :Use the live model;
endif
:Execute command on the chosen model;
note right
  Undo/redo navigate candidate history here.
  Unavailable steps are execution failures.
end note
if (Execution succeeds?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Report execution error and
do not save or publish;
  stop
endif
if (isReadOnly()?) then (yes)
  :Return result without a domain save
or history entry;
  stop
else (no)
endif
if (recordsHistory()?) then (yes)
  :Record candidate relative to live records;
  note right
    If data changed: discard redo, append state,
    retain at most 10 changes / 11 snapshots.
    If unchanged: preserve history and redo.
    All history changes remain candidate-only.
  end note
else (no)
  :Keep the chosen model's history and
do not append another action;
endif
:Atomically save the chosen model's records;
if (Save succeeds?) then (yes)
  if (isTransactional()?) then (yes)
    :publishTransaction(candidate) to
publish records and history to live model;
  else (no)
  endif
  :Return successful command result;
else (no)
  :Report CommandException with I/O cause and
do not publish candidate records or history;
endif
stop
@enduml
